<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cons Diamond issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Cons Diamond issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Consolidated Diamond Corp Ltd on Wednesday issued a further warning to shareholders to use caution when trading in its shares.</p>
<p>The firm first cautioned on January 21 and then again on March 4 and May 8.</p>
<p>The company gave no other details in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
